{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34416","headline":"奉和袭美宿报恩寺水阁 · 陆龟蒙","name":"奉和袭美宿报恩寺水阁","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"峰抱池光曲岸平，月临虚槛夜何清。\n僧穿小桧才分影，鱼掷高荷渐有声。\n因忆故山吟易苦，各横秋簟梦难成。\n周顒不用裁书劝，自得凉天证道情。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陆龟蒙","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_34416.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34416","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}